<title>USA: Bank of New York to buy back shrs.</title>
<headline>Bank of New York to buy back shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of New York Co Inc said Tuesday its board had approved a plan to buy back, through the end of 1997, up to 30 million of its common shares.</p>
<p>About 1.2 million shares will be used in connection with certain employee benefit plans, it said.</p>
<p>The company, which currently has about 392 million shares outstanding, said it had completed the repurchase of 52 million shares from buyback programs announced in November 1995 and June 1996.</p>
